{"4054220": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Unleash The Avatar", "steam_appid": 4054220, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054220/extras/d70e5fbbe3382f32c2adf23682a57d75.avif?t=1785316641\" width=1310 height=524 /></span>Play as Vikram, the protagonist set to find out what's going wrong in his home-town Vishwapur, a fictional land based in India. In this RPG, go through a handcrafted India from a past time, with areas and story based loosely on Indian mythology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054220/extras/2dec9f7eb518e94c70312a648cd52234.avif?t=1785316641\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054220/extras_big/2dec9f7eb518e94c70312a648cd52234.webp?t=1785316641 width=1560 height=81 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vishwapur is being overrun by schemers, demons, and mutated creatures. But why? What happened to this once peaceful town? Uncover who (or what) poisoned the town through cinematic storytelling, optional lore scrolls, and encounters that reveal more with every challenging boss victory.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054220/extras/dd37dda228380d2ae108f64cbcae1390.poster.avif?t=1785316641\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054220/extras/dd37dda228380d2ae108f64cbcae1390.webm?t=1785316641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054220/extras/dd37dda228380d2ae108f64cbcae1390.mp4?t=1785316641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054220/extras/1b27252bd7e73db8b08315039d774478.poster.avif?t=1785316641\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054220/extras/1b27252bd7e73db8b08315039d774478.webm?t=1785316641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054220/extras/1b27252bd7e73db8b08315039d774478.mp4?t=1785316641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054220/extras/d11fe26e447f9f9cac409659f16dd91c.avif?t=1785316641\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054220/extras_big/d11fe26e447f9f9cac409659f16dd91c.webp?t=1785316641 width=1560 height=81 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command a growing arsenal of flashy, powerful abilities hurl and recall the Chakra, unleash devastating sword arts, and chain abilities that shift the tide of any fight. Garuda's power runs deep  and as Vikram earns it, even his weapon shapeshifts to answer the call. Unlock new abilities and build your skill tree by proving your worth to Garuda. Find your combinations, master your arsenal, and forge your path to restore balance.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054220/extras/1668ed1b56e898a7cd8148109a958fc4.poster.avif?t=1785316641\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054220/extras/1668ed1b56e898a7cd8148109a958fc4.webm?t=1785316641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054220/extras/1668ed1b56e898a7cd8148109a958fc4.mp4?t=1785316641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054220/extras/5088e7bfd8a394cfb56be86aa184c7b2.poster.avif?t=1785316641\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054220/extras/5088e7bfd8a394cfb56be86aa184c7b2.webm?t=1785316641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054220/extras/5088e7bfd8a394cfb56be86aa184c7b2.mp4?t=1785316641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054220/extras/b74fe6a423c5d13c2e42f5d49adfc5c1.avif?t=1785316641\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054220/extras_big/b74fe6a423c5d13c2e42f5d49adfc5c1.webp?t=1785316641 width=1560 height=81 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the powers conferred to you, even if for a brief moment, to overpower your enemies. Each transformation unlocks new moves, counters, and mobility options, opening fresh ways to approach bosses, break stances, and dominate your enemies.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054220/extras/ba5d433d804d716fe9e65531b3c1531a.poster.avif?t=1785316641\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054220/extras/ba5d433d804d716fe9e65531b3c1531a.webm?t=1785316641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054220/extras/ba5d433d804d716fe9e65531b3c1531a.mp4?t=1785316641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054220/extras/71c306db3b8330fcd059fc29eeb38b16.poster.avif?t=1785316641\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054220/extras/71c306db3b8330fcd059fc29eeb38b16.webm?t=1785316641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054220/extras/71c306db3b8330fcd059fc29eeb38b16.mp4?t=1785316641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054220/extras/c361e290cd4f9b857fa3a2ec3f26da41.avif?t=1785316641\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054220/extras_big/c361e290cd4f9b857fa3a2ec3f26da41.webp?t=1785316641 width=1560 height=81 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054220/extras/2a253187b969e7becaa7560e64aefc3c.poster.avif?t=1785316641\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054220/extras/2a253187b969e7becaa7560e64aefc3c.webm?t=1785316641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054220/extras/2a253187b969e7becaa7560e64aefc3c.mp4?t=1785316641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Fight on your terms. Chain flashy dodges into brutal combos, unlock devastating Executions